      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785531619658,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\n\n** Simple polling **\nAdvantage\n* Simple to implement\n* stateless\n* No special infra needed\n* works in any standard network\nDisadvantage\n* High latency, update delated as polling interval \n+ time process request => more bandwidth usage\n* Limited update frequency\n* Resource intensive\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\n\n** Simple polling **\nAdvantage\n* Simple to implement\n* stateless\n* No special infra needed\n* works in any standard network\nDisadvantage\n* High latency, update delated as polling interval \n+ time process request => more bandwidth usage\n* Limited update frequency\n* Resource intensive\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
