    {
      "id": "RXCDund2A-Ws3mid22N3T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 948.668128156703,
      "y": -133.8539755963929,
      "width": 389.51065502125493,
      "height": 286.79880167021025,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b24",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1444412093,
      "version": 271,
      "versionNonce": 338855219,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785531634014,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// Client-side of long polling\nasync function longPoll() {\n  while (true) {\n    try {\n      const response = await fetch('/api/updates');\n      const data = await response.json();\n      \n      // Handle data\n      processData(data);\n    } catch (error) {\n      // Handle error\n      console.error(error);\n      \n      // Add small delay before retrying on error\n      await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 1000));\n    }\n  }\n}",
      "fontSize": 12.746613407564892,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// Client-side of long polling\nasync function longPoll() {\n  while (true) {\n    try {\n      const response = await fetch('/api/updates');\n      const data = await response.json();\n      \n      // Handle data\n      processData(data);\n    } catch (error) {\n      // Handle error\n      console.error(error);\n      \n      // Add small delay before retrying on error\n      await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 1000));\n    }\n  }\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A3x_Y-xrDBvH8BpuPvQAQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 349.23818518655514,
      "y": 446.8399821071001,
      "width": 628.199462890625,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b25",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1824877085,
      "version": 738,
      "versionNonce": 1268468723,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785528955148,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "** SSE -- Server side event (Efficient 1-way) **\n- Normal HTTP response with header Content-Length,\nSSE use \"Transfer-Encoding: Chunk\", tell client\nthe response is a series of chunk\n( we don't know how many and how big util we send them)\n- Instead of sending full response once data become\navailable, the server sends chunk of data, keeps\nrequest open to send more data as needed\n- Perfect use case when server need to push \ndata to client, but client don't need to send data back\n\n- How SSE works?\n1. Client establishes SSE connection\n2. Server keeps connection open\n3. Server sends messages when data changes or updates happen\n4. Client receives updates in real-time\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** SSE -- Server side event (Efficient 1-way) **\n- Normal HTTP response with header Content-Length,\nSSE use \"Transfer-Encoding: Chunk\", tell client\nthe response is a series of chunk\n( we don't know how many and how big util we send them)\n- Instead of sending full response once data become\navailable, the server sends chunk of data, keeps\nrequest open to send more data as needed\n- Perfect use case when server need to push \ndata to client, but client don't need to send data back\n\n- How SSE works?\n1. Client establishes SSE connection\n2. Server keeps connection open\n3. Server sends messages when data changes or updates happen\n4. Client receives updates in real-time\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
