    {
      "id": "CvUqo7YgmFbbX_ioNFn4u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1022.1390755585214,
      "y": 445.4272415897318,
      "width": 501.61968994140625,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 969925171,
      "version": 680,
      "versionNonce": 1959907955,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785529179760,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Advantage:\n* Build into browser, automatic reconnection\n* Simple implementation, work over HTTP\n* Efficient than long long pulling \n(less connection initiate/teardown)\n\nDisadvantage\n* One way communication only\n* Limited brower support\n* less network support => hard debug\n* Browser limit number of concurrent connection\nper domain\n* Request hang around for long time => hard debug\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Advantage:\n* Build into browser, automatic reconnection\n* Simple implementation, work over HTTP\n* Efficient than long long pulling \n(less connection initiate/teardown)\n\nDisadvantage\n* One way communication only\n* Limited brower support\n* less network support => hard debug\n* Browser limit number of concurrent connection\nper domain\n* Request hang around for long time => hard debug\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t16b163YuPRJ74vQAe6nZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 345.954050349169,
      "y": 970.1476970993001,
      "width": 734.45947265625,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 790069491,
      "version": 455,
      "versionNonce": 1482622973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785529811075,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "** Websocket -- bi-directional communication (high write/read frequency) **\n- Built on HTTP through upgrade protocol, \nallow existing TCP connection to change L7 protocols\n\n- How Websocket work\n1. Client initiates WebSocket handshake over HTTP\n2. Connection upgrades to WebSocket protocol\n3. Both client and server can send messages\n4. Connection stays open until explicitly closed",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** Websocket -- bi-directional communication (high write/read frequency) **\n- Built on HTTP through upgrade protocol, \nallow existing TCP connection to change L7 protocols\n\n- How Websocket work\n1. Client initiates WebSocket handshake over HTTP\n2. Connection upgrades to WebSocket protocol\n3. Both client and server can send messages\n4. Connection stays open until explicitly closed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
