    {
      "id": "3SM5PN64Ii3gWpXIG2gL1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2016.1705223551553,
      "y": 450.485074565017,
      "width": 364.3516845703125,
      "height": 280,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 932875699,
      "version": 583,
      "versionNonce": 1992952723,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785530003728,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** HOW TO HANDLE RECONNECTION ***\n\n* SSE connects won't live long (30-60s max)\n--> client need to re-establish connections and\nhow to deal with gaps in between\n* Standard SSE include \"last eventID\",\nwhich intend to cover the gap., \n* EventSource object explicitly handle\nreconnection in browser\n==> Client can reconnect and provide\nlast eventID it receive, server use\nthis eventID to send all the events\nthat occurred while client was disconnected\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** HOW TO HANDLE RECONNECTION ***\n\n* SSE connects won't live long (30-60s max)\n--> client need to re-establish connections and\nhow to deal with gaps in between\n* Standard SSE include \"last eventID\",\nwhich intend to cover the gap., \n* EventSource object explicitly handle\nreconnection in browser\n==> Client can reconnect and provide\nlast eventID it receive, server use\nthis eventID to send all the events\nthat occurred while client was disconnected\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
