      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785530292675,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Advantage\n* Read & write communication\n* Low latency than HTTP,\nreduce overhead\n* Efficient for frequent messages\n* Wide browser support\n\nDisadvantage\n* Complex to implement\n* Require special infrastructure\n* Stateful connection (more complex\nload balancing and scaling)\n* Need to handle reconnection\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Advantage\n* Read & write communication\n* Low latency than HTTP,\nreduce overhead\n* Efficient for frequent messages\n* Wide browser support\n\nDisadvantage\n* Complex to implement\n* Require special infrastructure\n* Stateful connection (more complex\nload balancing and scaling)\n* Need to handle reconnection\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
